# Motor speed. PDF page 17, printed page 15, block X.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
# XCR1/XCR2 are the 2.2uF timing capacitor nodes read as TTL levels at the
# 74S112 K inputs (analog boundary, see rtl/deathrac_audio.v). X999 is the
# 1.2k/.01 pull-up node shared by all U5/U7 preset and clear pins.
# Pin labels sit above the leads on U5a/U7a and below them on U5b/U7b; the
# output bubbles are drawn on pins 5 and 6 opposite to the 74S112 pinout.
# Connectivity follows pin numbers; with the drawn bubbles the oscillator
# would latch with the capacitor shorted.
chip U5 74112
chip U6 7407
chip U7 74112

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net 2TQLC U5.1 U5.13 U7.1 U7.13
net XCR1 U5.2 BOARD
net X999 U5.3 U5.4 U5.15 U5.10 U5.14 U7.3 U7.4 U7.15 U7.10 U7.14 BOARD
net 5XC11 U5.5 U6.3
net XC11 U5.6 U5.12 U5.11
net XC10 U5.9 U6.13
net 5XC10 U5.7 U6.1
net 6XC11 U6.4 BOARD
net XC1A U6.12 BOARD
net XC1B U6.2 BOARD
net XCR2 U7.2 BOARD
net 5XC21 U7.5 U6.11
net XC21 U7.6 U7.12 U7.11
net XC20 U7.9 U6.9
net 5XC20 U7.7 U6.5
net 6XC21 U6.10 BOARD
net XC2A U6.8 BOARD
net XC2B U6.6 BOARD
